**Status key:** `open` · `met` · `partial (exception noted)` · `gap`
**Mandatory (M) vs Desirable (D):** every M is a pass/fail gate and must be `met` before submission.
A **scored criterion that also carries a minimum pass mark** (e.g. "50 of 100 to pass") stays `D`
in this column — but write "(NN% pass mark applies)" into its Requirement text. Failing one ends
the bid as surely as an M, and a plain `D` hides that.
